            "id": "stairs_light_auto",
            "alias": "Stairs Light Auto On/Off",
            "description": "Echo presence with ecobee NOT detecting -> dim day/late-night brightness (defers to the 100% rule when the ecobee is detecting). Turns the stair light OFF when the ECOBEE stops detecting motion -- the Echo presence is unreliable, so it does not gate the off.",
